Apply the exact gate to DocumentationRelease: No unresolved blocking mismatch or broken executable example in the released bundle. Pass only when all decisive field relations are supported by current authorized evidence. Fail for a concrete contradiction or violated invariant. Needs-review when decisive evidence or authority is missing or unresolved.
